ate, and no penalty applies. We will</td><td></td><td></td></tr><tr><td></td><td>pay no more than $39,750 ($40,000 amount of loss</td><td></td><td></td></tr><tr><td></td><td>minus the deductible of $250).</td><td></td><td></td></tr></tbody></table>"
