  "ocr_data": [
    {
      "box_2d": [74, 92, 256, 118],
      "text_content": "COMMERCIAL PROPERTY"
    },
    {
      "box_2d": [74, 122, 236, 140],
      "text_content": "CP 10 30 09 17"
    },
    {
      "box_2d": [238, 234, 602, 272],
      "text_content": "CAUSES OF LOSS – SPECIAL FORM"
    },
    {
      "box_2d": [87, 163, 746, 185],
      "text_content": "Words and phrases that appear in quotation marks have special meaning. Refer to Section G. Definitions."
    },
    {
      "box_2d": [87, 205, 310, 224],
      "text_content": "A. Covered Causes Of Loss"
    },
    {
      "box_2d": [87, 234, 436, 277],
      "text_content": "When Special is shown in the Declarations,\nCovered Causes of Loss means direct physical\nloss unless the loss is excluded or limited in this\npolicy."
    },
    {
      "box_2d": [87, 288, 216, 306],
      "text_content": "B. Exclusions"
    },
    {
      "box_2d": [120, 317, 378, 361],
      "text_content": "1. We will not pay for loss or damage caused\ndirectly or indirectly by any of the following.\nSuch loss or damage is excluded regardless of\nany other cause or event that contributes"
    },
    {
      "box_2d": [120, 362, 313, 376],
      "text_content": "concurrently or in any sequence to the loss."
    },
    {
      "box_2d": [160, 387, 305, 405],
      "text_content": "a. Ordinance Or Law"
    },
    {
      "box_2d": [159, 415, 445, 435],
      "text_content": "The enforcement of or compliance with any\nordinance or law:"
    },
    {
      "box_2d": [199, 444, 474, 475],
      "text_content": "(1) Regulating the construction, use or\nrepair of any property; or"
    },
    {
      "box_2d": [199, 485, 474, 518],
      "text_content": "(2) Requiring the tearing down of any\nproperty, including the cost of removing\nits debris."
    },
    {
      "box_2d": [160, 530, 505, 552],
      "text_content": "This exclusion, Ordinance Or Law, applies\nwhether the loss results from:"
    },
    {
      "box_2d": [199, 561, 481, 593],
      "text_content": "(a) An ordinance or law that is enforced\neven if the property has not been\ndamaged; or"
    },
    {
      "box_2d": [199, 606, 480, 660],
      "text_content": "(b) The increased costs incurred to\ncomply with an ordinance or law in\nthe course of construction, repair,\nrenovation, remodeling or demolition\nof property, or removal of its debris,\nfollowing a physical loss to that"
    },
    {
      "box_2d": [199, 660, 255, 674],
      "text_content": "property."
    },
    {
      "box_2d": [160, 692, 297, 709],
      "text_content": "b. Earth Movement"
    },
    {
      "box_2d": [199, 722, 459, 754],
      "text_content": "(1) Earthquake, including tremors and\naftershocks and any earth sinking, rising\nor shifting related to such event;"
    },
    {
      "box_2d": [199, 765, 459, 797],
      "text_content": "(2) Landslide, including any earth sinking,\nrising or shifting related to such event;"
    },
    {
      "box_2d": [199, 808, 459, 841],
      "text_content": "(3) Mine subsidence, meaning subsidence\nof a man-made mine, whether or not\nmining activity has ceased;"
    },
    {
      "box_2d": [197, 587, 334, 911],
      "text_content": "(4) Earth sinking (other than sinkhole\ncollapse), rising or shifting including soil\nconditions which cause settling,\ncracking or other disarrangement of\nfoundations or other parts of realty. Soil\nconditions include contraction,\nexpansion, freezing, thawing, erosion,\nimproperly compacted soil and the\naction of water under the ground\nsurface."
    },
    {
      "box_2d": [340, 590, 400, 911],
      "text_content": "But if Earth Movement, as described in\nb.(1) through (4) above, results in fire or\nexplosion, we will pay for the loss or\ndamage caused by that fire or explosion."
    },
    {
      "box_2d": [404, 588, 501, 911],
      "text_content": "(5) Volcanic eruption, explosion or effusion.\nBut if volcanic eruption, explosion or\neffusion results in fire, building glass\nbreakage or Volcanic Action, we will pay\nfor the loss or damage caused by that\nfire, building glass breakage or Volcanic\nAction."
    },
    {
      "box_2d": [504, 616, 560, 911],
      "text_content": "Volcanic Action means direct loss or\ndamage resulting from the eruption of a\nvolcano when the loss or damage is\ncaused by:"
    },
    {
      "box_2d": [565, 615, 592, 910],
      "text_content": "(a) Airborne volcanic blast or airborne\nshock waves;"
    },
    {
      "box_2d": [597, 614, 623, 884],
      "text_content": "(b) Ash, dust or particulate matter; or"
    },
    {
      "box_2d": [629, 614, 655, 726],
      "text_content": "(c) Lava flow."
    },
    {
      "box_2d": [634, 616, 704, 911],
      "text_content": "With respect to coverage for Volcanic\nAction as set forth in (5)(a), (5)(b) and\n(5)(c), all volcanic eruptions that occur\nwithin any 168-hour period will constitute\na single occurrence."
    },
    {
      "box_2d": [709, 615, 781, 911],
      "text_content": "Volcanic Action does not include the\ncost to remove ash, dust or particulate\nmatter that does not cause direct\nphysical loss or damage to the\ndescribed property."
    },
    {
      "box_2d": [785, 593, 839, 911],
      "text_content": "This exclusion applies regardless of\nwhether any of the above, in Paragraphs\n(1) through (5), is caused by an act of\nnature or is otherwise caused."
    },
    {
      "box_2d": [954, 86, 1000, 200],
