      "text_content": "\"accident\" or \"electronic circuitry\nimpairment\"."
    },
    {
      "box_2d": [128, 118, 139, 133],
      "text_content": "e."
    },
    {
      "box_2d": [129, 145, 267, 165],
      "text_content": "DEFINITIONS"
    },
    {
      "box_2d": [143, 145, 171, 453],
      "text_content": "The following definitions are added\nwith respect to this endorsement only:"
    },
    {
      "box_2d": [176, 145, 187, 159],
      "text_content": "(1)"
    },
    {
      "box_2d": [177, 175, 250, 193],
      "text_content": "\"Accident\""
    },
    {
      "box_2d": [194, 175, 286, 453],
      "text_content": "(a) An \"accident\" means a fortuitous\nevent that causes direct physical\ndamage to \"covered equipment\"."
    },
    {
      "box_2d": [234, 203, 265, 453],
      "text_content": "The event must be one of the\nfollowing:"
    },
    {
      "box_2d": [269, 204, 280, 219],
      "text_content": "(i)"
    },
    {
      "box_2d": [269, 235, 312, 453],
      "text_content": "Mechanical breakdown,\nincluding rupture or bursting\ncaused by centrifugal force;"
    },
    {
      "box_2d": [317, 203, 328, 219],
      "text_content": "(ii)"
    },
    {
      "box_2d": [317, 233, 373, 453],
      "text_content": "Artificially generated electrical\ncurrent, including electric\narcing, that disturbs electrical\ndevices, appliances or wires;"
    },
    {
      "box_2d": [377, 204, 388, 219],
      "text_content": "(iii)"
    },
    {
      "box_2d": [377, 233, 447, 453],
      "text_content": "Explosion of steam boilers,\nsteam pipes, steam engines\nor steam turbines owned or\nleased by you, or operated\nunder your control;"
    },
    {
      "box_2d": [451, 204, 463, 220],
      "text_content": "(iv)"
    },
    {
      "box_2d": [451, 233, 537, 454],
      "text_content": "Loss or damage to steam\nboilers, steam pipes, steam\nengines or steam turbines\ncaused by or resulting from\nany condition or event inside\nsuch equipment; or"
    },
    {
      "box_2d": [540, 205, 551, 220],
      "text_content": "(v)"
    },
    {
      "box_2d": [540, 233, 625, 454],
      "text_content": "Loss or damage to hot water\nboilers or other water heating\nequipment caused by or\nresulting from any condition or\nevent inside such boilers or\nequipment."
    },
    {
      "box_2d": [628, 177, 640, 191],
      "text_content": "(b)"
    },
    {
      "box_2d": [628, 205, 655, 453],
      "text_content": "None of the following is an\n\"accident\":"
    },
    {
      "box_2d": [661, 205, 672, 220],
      "text_content": "(i)"
    },
    {
      "box_2d": [661, 233, 791, 454],
      "text_content": "Defect, programming error,\nprograming limitation,\ncomputer virus, malicious\ncode, loss of \"data\", loss of\naccess, loss of use, loss of\nfunctionality or other condition\nwithin or involving \"data\" or\n\"media\" of any kind; or"
    },
    {
      "box_2d": [794, 205, 805, 220],
      "text_content": "(ii)"
    },
    {
      "box_2d": [794, 233, 875, 454],
      "text_content": "Misalignment, miscalibration,\ntripping off-line, or any\ncondition which can be\ncorrected by resetting,\ntightening, adjusting or\ncleaning, or by the\nperformance of maintenance."
    },
    {
      "box_2d": [37, 658, 50, 703],
      "text_content": "However, if an"
    },
    {
      "box_2d": [38, 703, 50, 764],
      "text_content": "\"accident\""
    },
    {
      "box_2d": [37, 766, 50, 801],
      "text_content": "results,"
    },
    {
      "box_2d": [51, 658, 64, 906],
      "text_content": "we will pay for the resulting loss,\ndamage or expense caused by"
    },
    {
      "box_2d": [66, 658, 79, 766],
      "text_content": "that \"accident\"."
    },
    {
      "box_2d": [95, 599, 108, 614],
      "text_content": "(2)"
    },
    {
      "box_2d": [96, 626, 167, 906],
      "text_content": "\"Animal\" means any creature of the\nkingdom Animalia. This includes, but is\nnot limited to, amphibians, birds, fish,"
    },
    {
      "box_2d": [137, 628, 167, 906],
      "text_content": "insects, mammals, reptiles, and\nworms."
    },
    {
      "box_2d": [172, 599, 184, 614],
      "text_content": "(3)"
    },
    {
      "box_2d": [172, 626, 185, 838],
      "text_content": "\"Boilers and Vessels\" means:"
    },
    {
      "box_2d": [190, 628, 201, 643],
      "text_content": "(a)"
    },
    {
      "box_2d": [190, 658, 232, 906],
      "text_content": "Any boiler, including attached\nsteam condensate and feedwater\npiping; and"
    },
    {
      "box_2d": [237, 628, 249, 643],
      "text_content": "(b)"
    },
    {
      "box_2d": [237, 658, 292, 906],
      "text_content": "Any fired or unfired pressure\nvessel subject to vacuum or\ninternal pressure other than the\nstatic pressure of its contents."
    },
    {
      "box_2d": [297, 628, 339, 906],
      "text_content": "This term does not appear elsewhere\nin this endorsement, but may appear in\na \"Schedule\"."
    },
    {
      "box_2d": [344, 598, 357, 614],
      "text_content": "(4)"
    },
    {
      "box_2d": [344, 628, 567, 906],
      "text_content": "\"Cloud computing services\" means\nprofessional, on-demand, self-service\ndata storage or data processing\nservices provided through the Internet\nor over telecommunications lines. This\nincludes services known as IaaS\n(infrastructure as a service), PaaS\n(platform as a service), SaaS\n(software as a service) and NaaS\n(network as a service). This includes\nbusiness models known as public\nclouds, community clouds and hybrid\nclouds. \"Cloud computing services\"\ninclude private clouds if such services\nare owned and operated by a third\nparty."
    },
    {
      "box_2d": [571, 600, 584, 615],
      "text_content": "(5)"
    },
    {
      "box_2d": [571, 628, 585, 777],
      "text_content": "\"Covered equipment\""
    },
    {
      "box_2d": [588, 627, 646, 906],
      "text_content": "(a) \"Covered equipment\" means,\nunless otherwise specified in a\n\"Schedule\", Covered Property\nthat:"
    },
    {
      "box_2d": [650, 659, 661, 674],
      "text_content": "(i)"
    },
    {
      "box_2d": [650, 686, 679, 906],
      "text_content": "Transmits, generates or\nutilizes energy; or"
    },
    {
      "box_2d": [683, 658, 694, 674],
      "text_content": "(ii)"
    },
    {
      "box_2d": [683, 687, 739, 906],
      "text_content": "Which, during normal usage,\noperates under vacuum or\npressure, other than the\nweight of its contents."
    },
    {
      "box_2d": [744, 627, 786, 906],
      "text_content": "\"Covered equipment\" may utilize\nconventional design and technology or\nnew or newly commercialized design\nand technology."
    },
    {
      "box_2d": [791, 628, 802, 643],
      "text_content": "(b)"
    },
    {
      "box_2d": [791, 658, 833, 906],
      "text_content": "None of the following is \"covered\nequipment\":"
    },
    {
      "box_2d": [837, 659, 849, 673],
      "text_content": "(i)"
    },
    {
      "box_2d": [838, 687, 865, 906],
      "text_content": "Structure, foundation, cabinet\nor compartment;"
    },
    {
      "box_2d": [958, 69, 970, 142],
      "text_content": "CP7358(2-17)"
    },
    {
      "box_2d": [958, 287, 971, 703],
      "text_content": "Includes copyrighted material of ISO Properties, Inc. with its permission."
    },
    {
      "box_2d": [958, 848, 970, 908],
