"{
  "ocr_data": "CM7508(6-18)\nIncludes copyrighted material of American Association of Insurance Services, Inc., with its permission\nIncludes copyrighted material of ISO Properties, Inc. with its permission.\nPage 5 of 5\n(a) Replacement Cost Limitation -\nThe replacement cost is limited to\nthe cost of repair or replacement\nwith similar materials and used for\nthe same purpose. The payment\nwill not exceed the amount \"you\"\nspend to repair or replace the\ndamaged or destroyed property.\n(b) Time Limitation - \"You\" may make\na claim for actual cash value before\nrepair or replacement takes place,\nand later for the replacement cost if\n\"you\" notify \"us\" of \"your\" intent within\n180 days after the loss.\nc. Enhanced Cost To Repair - If a covered\nloss occurs to an item of Covered Property\nand the total amount of the cost to repair is\nless than 20% of the Actual Cash Value of\nthe item, at the time of loss, no depreciation\nwill be applied to the damaged Covered\nProperty in the settlement of the claim.\n2. Valuation For Equipment Leased or Rented\nFrom Others - The value of covered equipment\nthat \"you\" lease or rent from others will be based\non the valuation provisions described and agreed\nto in the lease or rental agreement between \"you\"\nand the owner of the equipment. In the absence\nof any agreement the valuation will be Actual\nCash Value.\n3. Security Deposit - \"We\" will deduct the amount\nof any security deposit \"you\" retain on Covered\nProperty leased or rented to others from what\n\"we\" would otherwise pay in the settlement of a\nclaim.\nb. Actual Cash Value - Increased Limit - In\nthe event of loss to covered scheduled\n\"contractors equipment\", when insured to at\nleast to 100% of actual cash value of all\ncovered equipment, \"we\" will pay up to 125%\nof the scheduled \"limit\" when replaced with\nlike kind and quality.",
